  "description": "Daheng Imaging camera adapter for Linkway.Vision.Capture. Discovers and captures from Daheng GigE Vision, USB3 Vision and USB2 cameras through the Galaxy (GxIAPI) runtime, behind the same ICaptureFacade as the other adapters. Devices are identified by their GenICam serial (daheng:serial:<sn>), acquisition parameters are declared before they are applied, and the package loads and behaves definedly on a host with no Galaxy runtime installed — an empty device list plus one warning, never a crash.",
